# Stable spec ID: iba-penicillin. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(Scotch whisky; blended) 60 ml
(Scotch whisky; single malt @ Lagavulin 16y) 7.5 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 22.5 ml
(honey syrup) 22.5 ml
(ginger, fresh) 2-3 quarter-size slices

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(fine strainer)
(old-fashioned glass)

::instructions
(ginger, fresh) <muddle, in (cocktail shaker)>
<add, all remaining measured ingredients except the (Scotch whisky; single malt @ Lagavulin 16y)>
<fill, shaker with ice> <shake>
<fine-strain, into a chilled (old-fashioned glass) with ice>
(Scotch whisky; single malt @ Lagavulin 16y) <float, on top>
<garnish, with candied ginger slices>

::notes
